	<meta property="og:description" content="Frieze Seoul is a leading international art fair by the team behind premium art fairs such as Frieze London, Frieze Masters, Frieze New York and Frieze Los Angeles. The fourth edition will take place from 2-5 September, 2026. Patrick Lee is the Director of Frieze Seoul. Frieze Seoul will offer both local and international audiences" />
